in?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... golai upar wala ank... woh 9 hai?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, golai upar wala ank 9 hai. Board par 6 ki golai neeche aur 9 ki upar hai. Ab batao, dono mein fark kya hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"6 ki golai neeche hai aur 9 ki golai upar hai... jaise aapne abhi bataya"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, tumne golai ki jagah sahi batayi. Ab ek chhota sa naya sawal: teen chidiya udd gayin, taar par kitni bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... zero... kyunki sab udd gayin toh taar pe koi nahi bachi"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, zero chidiya bachi, kyunki sab udd gayin. Zero se hum khaali taar ki ginti batate hain. Cricket mein batsman bina run banaye out ho, toh uska score kya hoga?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... ek? kyunki out toh hua par naam likhte hain na..."},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne kaha, out hua toh ek run hoga. Par out hona aur run banana alag hain. Do rotiyaan thi, dono kha li. Kitni bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero... koi roti nahi bachi... dono kha li na maine"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, zero roti bachi, kyunki tumne dono kha li. Zero se hum batate hain ki kuch nahi bacha. Cricket mein bina run banaye out ho jao, toh score kitna hoga?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero... kyunki aapne board pe likha 'run banaye: 0'... toh score bhi zero hoga"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, bina run banaye score zero hota hai. Teen se ulta gino: teen, do, ek, phir kya?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero... kyunki teen, do, ek ke baad zero aata hai... jaise kuch nahi bacha"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, ek ke baad ulta ginte hue zero aata hai. Tumne bina hint ke bataya. Ab socho, zero bhi number kyun hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"pata nahi… mujhe nahi aata yeh"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Koi baat nahi. Score batane ke liye number hota hai. Bina run banaye score zero hota hai. Ek run banaye toh score kya hota hai?"}],"usage":{"usd":0.07156,"tokens":53314},"boards":7,"lastMs":3915,"screen":{"on":"board","texts":["run 0","run 1"],"w